<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian five-week T-note yields 4.935 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian five-week T-note yields 4.935 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia</p>
<p>said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS1.1 bln   4.935	 4.90-4.94   5.200</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 20)</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   4.870	 4.86-4.88   5.090</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 69)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   4.850	 4.85 only   5.050</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 60)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
